  '种田': 'Farming',
  '城镇周围有四块田，越远的田能种越高阶的作物。站在田里点空地种下种子，浇水长得更快，熟了再点一下收获。': 'There are four fields around town, and the farther ones grow higher-tier crops. Stand in a field and tap an empty plot to plant. Watering speeds things up; tap again to harvest when it\'s ripe.',
