  "身边没有能开洞口的空地，或者已经开着 3 个洞口了。换个开阔的地方再试试（家园岛上和副本里都不能用）。": "There's no open ground nearby, or you already have 3 gates open. Try somewhere more open (keys don't work on your home island or inside dungeons).",
  "T{0} {1}": "T{0} {1}",
  "绿洞（单人地下副本）：1-4 层随机，一个人或组队都能进。": "Green Dungeon (solo dungeon): 1-4 random floors, enter solo or in a party.",
  "蓝洞（多人地下副本）：2-7 层随机，怪更强，必须组队才能进。队伍里每多一个人，你在蓝洞里伤害更高、受到的伤害更少。": "Blue Dungeon (group dungeon): 2-7 random floors, stronger monsters, party required. Each extra party member raises your damage and lowers damage taken in blue dungeons.",
  "洞口还有 {0} 消失（已经在里面的人不受影响）。每个洞口每人只能进一次。": "The gate vanishes in {0} (players already inside are unaffected). Each player can enter a gate once.",
  "清完所有层的所有怪，最后一层首领守着的宝箱才能打开。层数越多宝箱品质越好。": "Clear every monster on every floor to open the boss-guarded chest on the last floor. More floors means a better chest.",
  "（按平均层数估算）": "(estimated from average floors)",
  "寻路前往": "Walk there",
