  "家园农田": "Home Farm Plot",
  "一块 4×4 的田，能种所有已经解锁的作物（不分阶级），岛上任何地方都能打理，也能开自动补种、施肥、装洒水器。最多 8 块。": "A 4×4 field that grows every crop you've unlocked, whatever its tier. Tend it from anywhere on the island, with auto-replant, fertilizer and sprinklers. Up to 8 plots.",
